      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated clinicians amidst staffing friction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise individual veterinarians and veterinary technicians, such as Dr. Joy and Dr. Tognozzi, for their warmth, expertise, and thorough exams. In contrast, numerous pet parents express frustration with front-desk personnel and managers, citing rude attitudes and unhelpful responses."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent communication breakdowns and disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A substantial portion of feedback highlights poor customer service, including phone calls placed on prolonged hold, unconfirmed appointment slots, and inadequate medication guidance. While a few clients report helpful assistance upon arrival, many describe confrontational interactions with receptionists."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Extended check-in delays and reschedules"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently report significant wait times, often waiting thirty to forty minutes past their scheduled appointment time before being seen. Reviewers also criticize last-minute appointment cancellations, unexpected drop-off requirements, and delays when picking up pets."
      }
    }
  ],
